           <span id="alg2.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">upon</span> receiving <math id="alg2.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\langle\mathsf{Proof},\phi,\pi\right\rangle" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mi>𝖯𝗋𝗈𝗈𝖿</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>π</mi></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\langle\mathsf{Proof},\phi,\pi\right\rangle</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
