<figure id="alg3" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span> <math id="alg3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{VC}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝖵𝖢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{VC}</annotation></semantics></math>: Verifiable computation function</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
